## Handling oldPartKeyInfo and building the delete map

The old part (if a part with the same number already exists) is fetched and its replicated size is subtracted from `correctedSpace`. The map holds at most two entries per the comment: `"1. Overwritten part"` and `"2. Uncommitted pseudo part key"`.

```java
